<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHP" style="id">- Hona Bible</book>
  <para style="h">Filibiyaya</para>
  <para style="toc3">Filibiyaya</para>
  <para style="toc2">Filibiyaya</para>
  <para style="toc1">Filibiyaya</para>
  <para style="mt1">Filibiyaya</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHP 1" />
  <para style="s">Ndaˈya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 1:1" />Kyagha ɗeleewar ɗaɓa ya a har nda Mbulus tǝ Timoti mafaya Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti, a fingya heu na a takkwa Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti na tǝ tsaurha a Filibi heu tǝ shingya tǝ fingya na a ɗang kun sǝ. <verse eid="PHP 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 1:2" />Ngwa tsauka nggayid Faara na yinǝm China tǝ Chinǝm Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti tǝ kun.<verse eid="PHP 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hwanda Mbulus aten fatakkwaya Yeeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 1:3" />Ni naarha usa Faara a sayid ɗi ɗal ni teena hai tǝ kun. <verse eid="PHP 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 1:4" />Ƙǝtsar a naɗi a hwan Faara a tennun ni ǝnaghǝn tǝ wutsǝfayirha. <verse eid="PHP 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 1:5" />Tǝkɗi mbǝnda fa ƙǝsǝr wum ɗǝm teena hu pǝr laɓara na Mbǝnggǝn, ka a katǝradghǝn ta weeri ɗa ɓa ya. <verse eid="PHP 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 1:6" />Sǝnɗisǝ Faara katǝrangga tar ɗa hai na ngga ya ahur nun, nǝn a ɗǝrha mbeeɗǝ tǝghǝn kee ta farɗa ɗǝ na Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti a wutta ɓa. <verse eid="PHP 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 1:7" />Mǝmǝl ni a fadna a ni naarha ɗal kun teena heu ƙǝla ǝnani tǝ wutsǝfayirha, ƙǝsǝr nuwun ahur na, nuwun a wum teena tǝ nggi ahu nggayid Faara, heu tǝ muwenda hu porsǝna ɗǝ ish ni aten ƙǝkafekkid Laɓara na Mbǝnggǝn. <verse eid="PHP 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 1:8" />Faara sǝnɗasǝ nggǝm ɗi kun tǝ ƙǝm nǝn a kukwase fa a na kunni tǝ tur nggǝmnda Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti na niifa haɗang fa. <verse eid="PHP 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 1:9" />Hwandǝna kee, a mulgha nggǝmndǝ nun hai, hu huteena tǝ sǝnda kwaman Faara. <verse eid="PHP 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 1:10" />Nǝn ɗang kunsǝ a wur ˈya nun kamngga, ƙǝsǝr a fara na Ƙǝrǝsti a wutta ɓa a non chahal kula ǝn ˈyaara. <verse eid="PHP 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 1:11" />Ngwa tsaukwa yiɓǝdwa lǝlǝgɗa tǝ nggayid tarwa kyaghaɓa hu fǝrƙǝkafekkid wa hu Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti. Katǝra nǝn hai kee ƙǝsǝr ka a manang ngganda thlǝm Faara ni, tǝ fallǝghǝn ƙǝm.<verse eid="PHP 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">ˈYa na mid Mbulus a pǝr Laɓara nda na Mbǝnggǝn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 1:12" />Shayina, na minna sǝ a sǝnunsǝ, ǝnɗi katǝragha hai tǝ nggi ya nggǝr ɗǝ inang kwamana hai na a ɗǝgha laɓar Faara mbeeɗǝ. <verse eid="PHP 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 1:13" />Kowunni, heu tǝ sodjaya na a ƙǝla minda ki kutǝra ha tǝ chehwedɗi kahad sǝndasǝ muwegha nda hu porsǝna ɗǝ ƙǝsǝr ka nani mafad Ƙǝrǝsti. <verse eid="PHP 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 1:14" />Ƙǝsǝr ka nani hu porsǝna fa takkwa Chinǝm heu wal nda kanglanggirha na a pǝr laɓar Faara nda kula hǝreenga. <verse eid="PHP 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 1:15" />Fingya na nda pǝr laɓar Ƙǝrǝsti ka sǝrǝkkirha tǝ nggǝm alteena kee, amma fingya na nda ǝna yindan yi nggayirha. <verse eid="PHP 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 1:16" />Na nda a pǝr laɓar Faara yi nggǝmnda, sǝndasǝ fǝree nanda tar ɗiya a tsawi ƙǝsǝmnda yi pǝr Laɓara na mbǝnggǝn. <verse eid="PHP 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 1:17" />Fingya yini taarha na nda a pǝr laɓar Ƙǝrǝsti yi nggǝm alteena kee, mbǝ tǝ hura tal wa, na mindan sǝ a sǝsee ahu porsǝna. <verse eid="PHP 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 1:18" />Amma mbǝ ˈyasǝ wa. Ko na nda a sak ˈya ngga nduwa mbuwa ngga, nduwa ƙǝkafek ni na nanda a pǝr laɓar Ƙǝrǝsti, niyi tǝ wutsǝfayirha, ƙǝkafek niya chik ɗǝrha mbeeɗǝ tǝ ǝna wutsǝfayirha. <verse eid="PHP 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 1:19" />Sǝnɗisǝ ahu hwandǝ nun a tenna heu tǝ thlarra Sǝsǝn Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti sǝnɗisǝ na nda a kal nggi hai. <verse eid="PHP 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 1:20" />Niyi a nzǝm ndaarha mbǝ ˈyasǝ na keerha hu shilee hai malang nggi tar na wa, amma niyi tǝ fǝrƙǝkafek na a tsawi tǝ kanglanggirha hu Yeeso ƙǝla kaar. Fǝrɗi ƙǝkafek tǝ ndaarha ngwa manang ngganda thlǝm Ƙǝrǝsti a fad na ko nggi tǝ yibrha fa nduwa a mǝrɗi. <verse eid="PHP 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 1:21" />A fad na yibrha yi Ƙǝrǝsti ni, a mǝrɗi walla chikrha ni. <verse eid="PHP 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 1:22" />Amma a mǝryi wa, niya ǝna taara kaan yi Ƙǝrǝsti. Nanǝn kee sǝngwi ǝnɗi na minna wura wa. <verse eid="PHP 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 1:23" />Tsakh tenna hai sǝri. ˈYa na minna a ɗi thlǝmad Ƙǝrǝsti ɗǝ tsawan kyab, yanɗiya ndǝna mǝmǝl a fanna. <verse eid="PHP 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 1:24" />Amma ƙǝsǝr ka kun na minnun sǝ a ne tǝ yibrha fa. <verse eid="PHP 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 1:25" />Sǝnɗisǝ nǝghǝn kee, sǝnɗisǝ ƙǝm niya naarha tǝ kun heu tǝnun wal chikrha tǝ wutsǝfayirha, hu fǝrƙǝkafekkid nun. <verse eid="PHP 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 1:26" />A nggǝr ɗi wutta thlǝmad nun ɗǝ, nun a wal ǝn taala kaan tǝ Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti ƙǝsǝr ka ǝngya nǝn a ǝnaarha a tenna.<verse eid="PHP 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tsawama ƙǝla wangya talara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 1:27" />ˈYa kamngga, tsawama ƙǝla wangya talara, na a wudɗi ka ƙǝlang kun ɓa ko wudwi ɗǝ wa, a sǝk ndaarha ni, ishɗun ngga, mii nun tal hu ˈya nun a ǝnaarha ƙǝsǝr ka fǝrƙǝkafekkid ɗi yi Laɓar Ƙǝrǝsti na mbǝnggǝn. <verse eid="PHP 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 1:28" />A tǝrǝm ɗun fatsangginun wa. Tsawama tǝ hǝhasyirha ndǝna a kyad ndaarha na nda a ɓǝlang kanda, kun ƙǝm na nda a hǝrghang kun, ko Faara tafadghǝn. <verse eid="PHP 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 1:29" />Ƙǝsǝr fǝrangwa kwamana kun na fǝrƙǝkafek nun hu Ƙǝrǝsti Yeeso kewa, amma a sǝson ƙǝm ka ndǝghǝn. <verse eid="PHP 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 1:30" />Kun a habɓaarha tǝ tur yanɗi nanun sani fa, ndǝghǝn ni ƙǝm sǝk nun ɓal ni fadghǝn.<verse eid="PHP 1:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="PHP 2" />
  <para style="s">Tsawama tǝ mǝsǝlǝmnda Ƙǝrǝsti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 2:1" />Nuwun a wal kaali ka tsau nun yi Ƙǝrǝsti wa? Nduwa nuwun a wal nggabrha ahu nggǝm ndǝghǝn wa? Nduwa nuwun ahu tsawud ɗǝɗemnggirha hu Sǝsǝna wa? Nduwa ƙǝm nuwun a nggǝm ndan tǝ haɗang nda ndan fa wa? <verse eid="PHP 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 2:2" />Niya hwan kun, ngwa lǝghǝdgha wutsǝfayid na ahu tsawud nun tǝ numarha tal, tǝ nggǝmnda tal, non hu sǝsǝna tal tǝ ˈya na minnun tal. <verse eid="PHP 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 2:3" />Ana ɗun a ǝna ˈya tǝ nggǝm alteena nduwa tǝ manang nda alteena wa, amma tsawama mǝsǝlǝmnda nafiya. Kowunni nagha tǝr shadghǝn niifa ni kalgha ndǝn mu. <verse eid="PHP 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 2:4" />A ƙǝlang na ˈya na midwa kee wa, amma ƙǝlang ǝngya na mid fingya ƙǝm. <verse eid="PHP 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 2:5" />Tsawama tǝ halla Ƙǝrǝsti Yeeso fa. <verse eid="PHP 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 2:6" />Ko nanǝn Faara ni ndǝghǝn, mǝmǝlangwa fadghǝn tǝ Faara na a ƙǝsghǝnǝn tǝ shembe wa. <verse eid="PHP 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 2:7" />Tsawanggǝn altenggǝn ƙǝla mbǝ ka niifa ni wa, tǝrghǝn fadghun ƙǝla mafarha, ahu thlu farha nggǝt na ndan, kyad fadghǝnǝn ƙǝm hu thlu farha. <verse eid="PHP 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 2:8" />Tsaunǝn ƙǝla niifa, manang ngwa altenggǝn wa, tǝ ƙǝm nagha a ǝna taara tǝ ˈya na mid Faara tǝ ƙǝm nggǝm ɗa fa na a mǝrgha, mǝra ƙǝla tǝ mbǝlfeerha aten kaɗiirha.<verse eid="PHP 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 2:9" />Tsaunǝn kee, fǝrang Faara mamnggirha kaan, ɗǝfang thlǝma nǝn kalgha tur thlǝma, <verse eid="PHP 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 2:10" />ƙǝsǝr ka thlǝm Yeeso kala niifa nǝn a ɓǝrang nda hai tǝ waɗedghǝn, a talara tǝ ƙǝshiirha tǝ kamu chehweerha. <verse eid="PHP 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 2:11" />Kala sheneurha nǝn a ndaarha Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti Chinǝm ni, ƙǝsǝr a manangganda Faara na Chinɗi.<verse eid="PHP 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngwa djargha kukwaryid nun hai hu ƙǝshiirha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 2:12" />Tsau nǝn kee, kun shayina nggǝm ni, niya hwan kun, kǝla nun yakh nggǝm miina fa hu sayidɗi nani tǝ kun, ko mbuwa ni a thlǝman nun nanǝnya, ɗaama mbeeɗǝ tǝ ǝna taara tǝ ˈya nun a sǝkrha a miina. Ndeeman yid nun tǝ ǝna taara tǝna kwaman hǝrǝkrǝ nun kyarha pǝpal ɓa, ǝnamadghǝn tǝ tǝrǝm Faara, nagha fad nun a rǝprha fa. <verse eid="PHP 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 2:13" />Ƙǝsǝr Faara ndǝna a ǝna taara ahur nun, tǝnun ǝna ˈya tǝrna midghǝn. <verse eid="PHP 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 2:14" />Kala ˈya nun a ǝnaarha ǝnamadghǝn kula huhurumnda nduwa ngaala, <verse eid="PHP 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 2:15" />tǝnun tsaurha kula ǝn ˈyaara fa, non chahal ƙǝla wangya Faara mbuwa tǝ ɗimiyirha fa ahu sayid ƙǝshidɗiya na ten fiya kakrak, fa mbǝlfeeya nagha kukwaryid nun a djaara hai ahur ndan ƙǝla kukwaryirha hu ƙǝshidɗiya. <verse eid="PHP 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 2:16" />Tǝ ƙǝm ƙǝsaama laɓar wal yibrha, tǝni wal ǝn taala a far ɓad Yeeso ɓa sǝsanna tǝ tarna mbǝ tsaurha mere wa. <verse eid="PHP 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 2:17" />Amma ko na nda ireeɗǝ ƙǝla ǝn saarha yi fǝra a mbǝd fǝr sataka tǝ ǝna taara kyagha ɓa ahu fǝrƙǝkafekkid nun, niyi tǝ wutsǝfayirha tǝ kun heu. <verse eid="PHP 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 2:18" />Nanǝn kee kun ƙǝm tǝgha mbǝnda fa ǝna wutsǝfayirha nun tǝ nggi.<verse eid="PHP 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Timoti tǝ Abaforiditus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 2:19" />Niyi a ndaarha a nggǝm Chinǝm Yeeso fa, tsǝɓaku niya thlǝnang Timoti a thlǝman nun ɗǝ, tǝni wal kaali a sǝkɗi laɓar nun ɓa. <verse eid="PHP 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 2:20" />Mbǝ niifa sǝ nani tǝghǝn ƙǝla Timoti wa ɓillagha kaan tǝ kun wa. <verse eid="PHP 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 2:21" />Kowunni ƙǝl ˈya ɓillagha kanda fa kee, mbǝ yi Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti wa. <verse eid="PHP 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 2:22" />Amma kun sǝnɗun tsawud Timoti, ǝna ɗan tar pǝr Laɓaara na Mbǝnggǝn ƙǝla nda wee tǝ chin. <verse eid="PHP 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 2:23" />Tsaunǝn kee niyi a ndaarha niya thlǝnang a thlǝman nun ɗǝ a hǝrǝm ɗi sǝk ˈya na a katǝrarha hai tǝ nggi. <verse eid="PHP 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 2:24" />A nggǝm Chinǝm fa tsǝɓaku nggi tafanna ma niya ɗǝrha ɗǝ. <verse eid="PHP 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 2:25" />Amma ƙǝla ɗi hai ƙǝm kamɗǝ a nggǝryi thlǝnang Abaforiditus kun ɗǝ wan maana. Pashid tarna ni, nan a ǝna tar sodja kyap, tǝthlǝndǝ nun ni puwang nun ɓa ka ɓagha ɗeesǝ. <verse eid="PHP 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 2:26" />Nǝghǝn a kukwasang fa ka a na kun nǝn heu, tǝ ƙǝm ɓilla ɗǝ kaan ƙǝsǝr sǝkɗun ndaarha mbǝ kanglang wa. <verse eid="PHP 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 2:27" />Ƙǝkafek hadɗǝ kaan har takhɗǝ a mǝra. Amma haɗang Faara fa, mbǝ ndǝghǝn katenggǝn wa, heu tǝ nggi. A mbǝ kee wa kam na hurna a sǝbrha ɗǝ kaan. <verse eid="PHP 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 2:28" />Tsaunǝn kee ndǝn ndaani niya nggǝr thlǝnggǝn a thlǝman nun ɗǝ tǝnun naghǝn tǝk mbǝnda nun fa, nggi ƙǝm mbi ɓillarha kaan wa. <verse eid="PHP 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 2:29" />Thlamadghǝn fa tǝ wutsǝfayirha ahu thlǝm Chinǝm. Fǝraman mamnggirha tǝ fingya na ƙǝla ndǝghǝn. <verse eid="PHP 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 2:30" />Takhɗǝ a mǝra ƙǝsǝr ka tar Ƙǝrǝsti. Nǝghǝn a fǝr yiɓǝdghǝn ƙǝsǝr a ɗeeghǝn sǝ tǝ taara yi mbangwa nun ǝnaarha.<verse eid="PHP 2:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="PHP 3" />
  <para style="s">Nggayirha yi ƙǝkafek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 3:1" />A mii ngwala laɓarna, pashiyina, ǝnama wutsǝfayirha tǝ Chinǝm. Mbǝ ɓilla nggi fa a nggǝryi chireethleng kun ɗǝ aten ǝnggini ˈwani pǝrang kun wa, ƙǝsǝr a ǝnaɗi kee nǝn a ɗang kun sǝ. <verse eid="PHP 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 3:2" />Kwarama tǝ wuɗayini ya na a ǝna tar mbǝlfeerha, na a ndaarha ƙǝl thleena niifa muwa ndǝnǝn wal hǝrǝkrha. <verse eid="PHP 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 3:3" />Ƙǝsǝr kan ni fathlee muya yi ƙǝkafek, kan na a fǝrang mamnggirha Faara tǝ sǝsǝnggǝn, na a ǝna taala tǝ Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti, mbǝrsa wan tǝ tar thlu farha wa. <verse eid="PHP 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 3:4" />Ko nanǝn nggi ni mbang mbǝrsaarha tǝ tar altenna. Ana niifa sǝ na a ndaarha nǝghǝn a mbǝrsaarha tǝ tar altenggǝn, nggi kalɗi ndǝn mu. <verse eid="PHP 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 3:5" />Thleegha nda muwa a sayidɗi sǝl ni ɓeena wuvaɗa, nggi tǝ Isǝreela ni, turya Mbenjemen, wangya Ibraniyaya. Aten tsahad ɗeleewar ngyakhrha Musa, nggi tǝ Farisarha ni. <verse eid="PHP 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 3:6" />Niyi a ndi farha hai aten takkwa ngyakhrha Musa, ni naarha sǝsang nda fa takkwaya Yeeso. Aten nggayirha niyi a takkwa ngyakhrha mǝmǝl. <verse eid="PHP 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 3:7" />A farɗi numayi tǝ ndaarha ka ˈya niya ǝnaarha. Amma nanǝnya ƙǝlang ɗi mbǝ ka ˈyani wa ƙǝsǝr ka Ƙǝrǝsti. <verse eid="PHP 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 3:8" />Tsawang ɗi ǝngginiya mbǝ ka ˈyani wa, ƙǝsǝr ka sǝnda Ƙǝrǝsti Yeeso Chinǝm. Ƙǝsǝr ka ndǝghǝn ni malang ni ǝngya heu, tsawang nggi kanda ǝngya ni mere kee tǝni wal chikrha ka tsauna Ƙǝrǝsti yina, <verse eid="PHP 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 3:9" />tǝni tsaurha ahurghǝn. Mbǝ ka nggayid na niya laf ngyakhrha ɗeleewar Musa wa, ƙǝsǝr ka nggayid ɗi ni waala a fad Yeeso hu fǝrƙǝkafek. <verse eid="PHP 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 3:10" />Na minna sǝ a sǝn Ƙǝrǝsti ni tǝ sǝsǝmnda thliidghǝn sǝ ahur mǝrra, na miina sǝ a sǝsee tǝghǝn, tsawi ƙǝla ndǝghǝn ahu mǝrrǝghǝn, <verse eid="PHP 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 3:11" />na minnasǝ ko ƙǝƙǝn ni a wal thliirha ni sǝ ahu mǝra hu yibrha ɗǝ.<verse eid="PHP 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndiyirha hu ˈya na minnǝm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 3:12" />Mbiyi a ndaarha ˈwaɗi teena walɗi ǝngginiya wa, nduwa tsawi ƙǝla Yeeso wa. Amma niyi a ndeng yidna tǝni wal ǝnɗi kyana Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti ƙǝs nggi ha kamanggǝn. <verse eid="PHP 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 3:13" />Awo, Shayina, nawi fanna ƙǝsɗi ndǝn ha wa. Amma djanggi yirha ˈya tal kee, mbǝɗe ˈya mbǝrgha ɗǝ, niyi a ndeng yinna a ǝna ǝnɗa ni na a mbee. <verse eid="PHP 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 3:14" />Niyi a ndeng yinna a wal ǝnɗani na miina, tǝni wal ƙǝna ǝnɗi kyana Faara aah nggi talara hai hu Ƙǝrǝsti Yeeso. <verse eid="PHP 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 3:15" />Tsaunǝn kee ƙǝm shinggi ahu sǝsǝna tama nam tǝ tur hallǝɗi thlǝkni ya. Amma ana fingya sǝ na tǝ ˈya mii pak, na Faara a kyaɗanggǝn kun a pǝpal. <verse eid="PHP 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 3:16" />ˈYa kamngga tama ɗǝm mbeeɗǝ tǝghǝn kee. <verse eid="PHP 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 3:17" />Shayina, takkwama ˈya ǝnani, tǝ ƙǝm ƙǝlaman wid fingya na mǝmǝl kǝla nǝm ǝnaarha. <verse eid="PHP 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 3:18" />Ƙǝla ni ˈwani pǝrang nda kun, nanǝnya ma niya nggǝr pǝranggǝn kun, tǝ aam yirha hu yidna, na fingya sǝ ahu windan hai, kyadɗǝ ndarha fatsangya kaɗid Ƙǝrǝsti ni. <verse eid="PHP 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 3:19" />A mii ngwaladghǝn na nda a ɗǝrha ahu hwanga ɗǝ. Faar ndan hur ndan ni. Yamid shili ndan ndǝna nda taala sǝ, numan ndan heu nǝghǝn aten ǝn ƙǝshiirha. <verse eid="PHP 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 3:20" />Amma wangya kutǝryid talara ni ƙǝm, nǝghǝn a kukwasang ƙǝm fa ƙǝla ɓad Tǝhǝrǝkrǝ nǝm fa Chinǝm Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti, a talara hai. <verse eid="PHP 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 3:21" />Ndǝghǝnni tǝ sǝsǝmnda na a ɓang ǝngya ɓa heu a kamu kutǝryidghǝn ɓa. Tǝ sǝsǝmnggit ɗa ni keeghǝn nǝn a kyakhrang mǝrra fad nǝm hai tsawanggǝn ƙǝla fadghǝn yi mamnggirha.<verse eid="PHP 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="PHP 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 4:1" />Tsaunǝn kee, shayina nggǝmni, tsawama tǝ shembe hu Chinǝm. Nggǝmɗi kun har nǝghǝn a kukwaseefa a na kunni. Shayina kunni wutsǝfayid na tǝ ƙǝna tarna.<verse eid="PHP 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isha tǝ shembe ka Chinǝm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 4:2" />Niyi a hwan Yudiya tǝ Sǝntiki, a tsaukwa mii ndan tal hu Chinǝm. <verse eid="PHP 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 4:3" />Sa na ka pashid tarna na tǝ ƙǝkafek fa, niya hwan sa ɗang nishyina sǝ kyab ya na a tsawa nda ɗǝɗem tǝ ndan, ƙǝsǝr habɓan nda tǝ nggi ahu pǝr Laɓarɗi na Mbǝnggǝn ya. Ənanda taara heu tǝ Ƙǝlamen tǝ fingya pashiya tarna, kanda na thlǝm ndan chichireethlee hai ahu Ɗeleewar fǝr Yibrha. <verse eid="PHP 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 4:4" />Tsawama ƙǝtsar tǝ wutsǝfayirha fa ahu Chinǝm, niyi a nggǝr ndaarha tsaama tǝ wutsǝfayirha fa. <verse eid="PHP 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 4:5" />Ƙǝrsaama tǝ kowunni, a sǝnunsǝ takh chinǝm a ɓaarha ɓa. <verse eid="PHP 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 4:6" />A ɓillaɗun tǝ koma wa, amma kala ˈya katǝragha hai pǝra man ndǝghǝn Faara hu hwanda tǝ usa Faara ƙǝm. <verse eid="PHP 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 4:7" />Ɗǝɗemnggid Faara, kalgha sǝnda niifa mu, nǝn a laf hur nun tǝ huten nun ahu Ƙǝrǝsti Yeeso. <verse eid="PHP 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 4:8" />A mii ngwaladghǝn shayina, kala ˈya na tǝ ƙǝkafek fa, komani yi fǝr mamnggirha, komani na mǝmǝl, komani na chahal, komani yi nggǝmnda, komani yi suna, a na ˈya sǝ na ngga kaan, nduwa yi faala, numama aten ǝngginiya. <verse eid="PHP 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 4:9" />Ənama taara tǝ ˈya tsaha nun tǝ thlǝnun, tǝ ƙǝm sǝk nun, tǝ nanun a fadna. Faara na tǝ tsawud ɗǝɗemnggirha ha nǝn a naarha tǝ kun ha.<verse eid="PHP 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Usa Mbulus Filibiyaya ka fǝrrǝ ndan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 4:10" />Ənaɗi wutsǝfayirha kaan tǝ Chinǝm ƙǝsǝr nanǝnya kyadɗǝ ndaarha nggǝrɗun ɓillarha tǝ nggi. Ƙǝkafek ɓillaɗun tǝ nggi, amma wal wun kwamana keɗee kunun wa. <verse eid="PHP 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 4:11" />Mbǝ nani a ndarha kee ka yamirha wa, ƙǝsǝr tsaha ɗi ƙǝrǝsta tǝ ˈya na a harna. <verse eid="PHP 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 4:12" />Sǝnɗi kwaman tsawud na ko hu yamirha ko hu walaha. Ni mbang ƙǝrǝs tsaurha ko nǝghǝn ƙǝƙǝn, ko hu mirha ni ko hu nggaala, ko hu yamirha ko hu walaha. <verse eid="PHP 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 4:13" />Ni mbang ǝna ǝngya heu hu Ƙǝrǝsti na a fǝre shembe. <verse eid="PHP 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 4:14" />Ko nanǝn kee, ɗee ɗun sǝ a sayidɗi nani hu sǝsaarha. <verse eid="PHP 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 4:15" />Kun Filibiyaya sǝnɗunsǝ hu sayidɗi katǝrang ni pǝr Laɓar ɗa hai na Mbǝnggǝn, malni chehweed Makidoniya mbǝ nafiya sǝ na a takkwa Yeeso wumngga teena tǝ nggi hu fǝra tǝ thlǝrha wa ƙǝl kun katen nun kee. <verse eid="PHP 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 4:16" />Ƙǝsǝr ko a sayidɗi nani a Tasalonika, nun thlǝne ǝngya ɗǝ na minna. <verse eid="PHP 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 4:17" />A ndaaɗun na minna sǝ a fǝre ˈya nun wa, awo, ˈya niya kaɗaarha kee tǝnun wal ƙǝna tar nun. <verse eid="PHP 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 4:18" />Nanǝnya kala ˈya na minna asǝ a harna kalgha mbǝrha mu, tsau nǝn walɗi ǝngya fǝre nun a har Abaforiditus. Fǝr yini ya na sǝdghǝn mbǝnggǝn, sataka ni ƙǝm na Faara a thlǝrha tǝ wutsǝfayirha. <verse eid="PHP 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 4:19" />Na Faar na a fǝrang ǝngya kun na mid nun mamnggid ƙǝnaghǝn hu Ƙǝrǝsti Yeeso. <verse eid="PHP 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 4:20" />Mamnggirha tsauɗǝ yi Faara na Chinɗi pakwanɗǝ. Atsaukake.<verse eid="PHP 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngwala mii ndaˈya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 4:21" />Ndaman ˈya nafiya Faara fa hu Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PHP 4:21">Shayina nanan a mbǝɗiya kanda a ndangˈya kun fa. <verse eid="PHP 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 4:22" />Nafiya Faara heu na a mbǝɗiya kanda a ndangˈya kun fa, mbǝ ƙǝlama fingya na a minda ki Kaisar wa. <verse eid="PHP 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 4:23" />Ngwa tsauka nggayid Chinǝm Yeeso Ƙǝrǝsti tǝ kun. Atsaukake.<verse eid="PHP 4:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 4" />
</usx>